      "title": "Qt: Fix width of \"show up to...\" prefs in some styles",
      "message": "Qt: Fix width of \"show up to...\" prefs in some styles\n\nFor some styles, e.g. adwaita, the style adds extra space\naround the contents. When setting the maximum width of the\nwidget, this has to be taken into account, so ask the style\nhow wide we need to make the line edits to fit our contents.\nOtherwise, it's not wide enough to fit the text.\n",
